      "label": "02 · §22.2 Derivation",
      "title": "Malus's law for intensity transmitted by an analyser",
      "legend": "Incident linearly polarised wave of amplitude \\(E_0\\) along \\(x\\) (intensity \\(I_0 = K E_0^2\\)) incident on analyser \\(P_2\\) at angle \\(\\theta\\) (Eq. 22.9, Fig. 22.6).",
